WEBVTT

NOTE
Captions for phuongha.loans hero story video.
Timings are an editing starting point (~48s total) — nudge the cue
times to match your final edit. Keep each cue ~1-2 short lines.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
I get it — because I'm living it too.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.000
Three boys in baseball.
Two of my kids graduating.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.000
Watching them grow up fast.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.000
So I know the feeling…

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.400
…wanting to give them everything,

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:22.500
and still trying to get your family
into a home of your own.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.000
And let's be honest — who's got an extra
twenty percent just sitting there?

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:30.000
Ten? Even five?

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:33.400
But that home is still the goal.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.500
So give me five minutes.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:41.500
There are Down Payment Assistance programs
built for people just like you — and just like me.

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:45.500
Let me show you the options
you didn't know you had.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:48.000
Give me a call.
